#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:5 ffb8f862752248e78e87ac1af7ae1e55
msgid "Crash Check"
msgstr "碰撞检测"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:7 63e792b663fb4210858154b80b4777f5
msgid ""
"Sub includes a crash check which can disarm the motors in cases where the "
"vehicle is likely out of control and has hit something.  This reduces damage"
" to the vehicle and its surroundings, and also reduces the chance of injury "
"to people or creatures nearby."
msgstr ""
"水下机器人包含碰撞检测功能，当飞行器可能失控并撞上障碍物时可自动锁定电机。这有助于减少对飞行器及周围环境的损坏，并降低对附近人员或生物造成伤害的风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:10 0a4b581a149044e8916abd5ae2500511
msgid "When will the crash check disarm the motors?"
msgstr "坠机检测何时会上锁电机？"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:11 f9c8a03f605d414b8f5eb675a416bd1f
msgid "When all the following are true for 2 full seconds:"
msgstr "当以下所有条件连续满足 2 秒时："

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:13 131f7838650b44a38b394a03bcebba1b
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK<FS_CRASH_CHECK>` = 2 ( A value of \"0\" disables "
"the check while \"1\" will send only a warning to the GCS)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK<FS_CRASH_CHECK>` = 2（值为 「0」禁用该检测，值为 「1」仅向地面站发送警告）"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:14 62bff250dc46415f901ab2920d75899f
msgid "The vehicle is armed"
msgstr "飞行器已解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:15 9513440c990e45179d4a77f6e7f12866
msgid "The current flight mode is *not* ACRO or MANUAL"
msgstr "当前飞行模式*不是* Acro 或 Manual"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:16 47849725f40e40448ec8d7f80b606fac
msgid ""
"The actual lean angle has diverged from the desired lean angle (perhaps "
"input by the pilot) by more than 30 degrees."
msgstr "实际倾斜角与期望倾斜角（可能由飞手输入）的偏差超过 30 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:19 13480086dfcb4f3ebaa2c3d501bb4a42
msgid "What will happen when the crash check fires?"
msgstr "坠机检测触发后会发生什么？"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:21 21bc69ca8196495e9df0de5d82f1c4a8
msgid "The motors will disarm"
msgstr "电机将被锁定"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:22 f360a2d37aa44b3396cf99cbe48d57b6
msgid "\"Crash: Disarming\" will be displayed on the Ground Station"
msgstr "地面站将显示 「Crash: Disarming」（碰撞：正在锁定）"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:23 6e274ad2ee3e4afd908f6ae45feef55c
msgid ""
"A crash event will be written to the dataflash logs (look for EV, 12 in the "
"logs)"
msgstr "碰撞事件将写入数据闪存日志（在日志中查找 EV, 12）"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:26 6cfd4e8ad5434c36beca5aaec83caf16
msgid "How and when should the crash check be disabled?"
msgstr "何时以及如何禁用坠机检测？"

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:27 244f2a1b61214211a66474ef017b2b86
msgid ""
"In general the crash check should be left enabled but if the vehicle is "
"likely to suffer from lean angle errors of over 30 degrees for a second or "
"more it should be disabled."
msgstr "通常应保持碰撞检测启用状态，但如果飞行器可能出现超过 30 度的倾斜角误差且持续一秒或更长时间，则应将其禁用。"
